{"product_id":"geog-2","title":"Geog.2.","description":"\u003cp\u003egeog.123 is a three-book course for the National Curriculum at Key Stage 3. This 4th edition has been specially written to match the new Programme of Study. geog.1 includes the geological timescale, mapskills, the UK, glaciation, rivers, and Africa. This workbook provides extra, engaging activities to supplement geog.123 lessons. It offers skills practice, and each topic concludes with a revision exercise to allow students to consolidate their learning; it is ideal for homework and independent study. A teacher's answer book is also available, for quick, painfree marking.\u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:2 x 280  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Justin Woolliscroft \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780198393061 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 72\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44561740333209,"sku":"2EDU-29780198393061","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/c750869631bb9f026d943a3e9c98c6a5.jpg?v=1720514645","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/geog-2","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}